    "study_design": "Factorial randomized, controlled trial; central, computer-based randomization was stratified according to several factors, including study center and presence or absence of a history of major vascular disease.",
    "inclusion_criteria": "Diagnosis of type 2 diabetes mellitus at 30 years of age or older, an age of at least 55 years at the time of study entry, and a history of major macrovascular or microvascular disease or at least one other risk factor for vascular disease.",
    "exclusion_criteria": "A definite indication for, or contraindication to, any of the study treatments or a definite indication for long-term insulin therapy at the time of study entry.",
